  "track_purpose": "EVENT_DAY evidence track (owner decision 2026-09-26). Forebet does not publish basketball / hockey / baseball / tennis / rugby boards more than about a day ahead, so those sports are structurally unreachable under the frozen 24h date-anchored gate and the standard track produced football-only rank-1 picks on 2026-09-21..26. This track decides on the event day and proves pre-event status per event against the published kickoff. It is a SEPARATE, WEAKER-LEAD-TIME experiment: its artifacts live under their own root, carry track=EVENT_DAY, and are never pooled with the 24h-frozen record or reported as part of it."
